# Keep every checked-out text file LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true by default) rewrites files to
# CRLF on checkout, and the plugin/skill validators -- which parse YAML
# frontmatter with `\n`-anchored patterns -- report valid files as invalid.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
